---
// About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-16 bg-[#F2F2F2] font-sans">
    <!-- Top: Heading + Intro -->
    <div
        class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start mb-12 gap-8"
    >
        <h2
            class="text-4xl md:text-2xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-[#1A1A1A] leading-[1.1] md:max-w-sm"
        >
            Clean &amp; Simple <br />Design Strong Results.
        </h2>
        <div class="md:max-w-md">
            <p
                class="text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] leading-snug"
            >
                Hey, I'm Masjidul, A Digital Designer Focused On Simple, Smart,
                And Intentional Design That Actually Works.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom: Image + Content -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
        <!-- Image -->
        <div class="md:col-span-5">
            <img
                src="/masjidul.png"
                alt="Masjidul - Digital Designer"
                width="600"
                height="600"
                class="rounded-2xl w-full h-72 sm:h-96 md:h-auto object-cover object-top shadow-sm"
                loading="lazy"
            />
        </div>

        <!-- Text Content -->
        <div class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-5">
            <span
                class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 border border-gray-400 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold w-fit text-gray-700"
            >
                About Me
            </span>

            <div
                class="space-y-5 text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-gray-700 leading-relaxed"
            >
                <p>
                    With 4 Years Of Experience As A UI/UX Designer, I Don't Just
                    Build Interfaces; I Build Engines For Digital Success. My
                    Approach Combines Deep Empathy For The User With A Sharp
                    Focus On Business Objectives, Specializing In SaaS,
                    E-Commerce, And High-Growth Startup Ecosystems.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Throughout My Career—Collaborating With Forward-Thinking
                    Teams Like Signature Park And AdSession.Uk—I've Learned That
                    The Best Designs Are The Ones That Disappear, Leaving Only A
                    Seamless Experience For The User And Tangible ROI For The
                    Stakeholder.
                </p>

                <div class="space-y-3 pt-1">
                    <p>
                        <span class="block font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] mb-1"
                            >Why Work With Me?</span
                        >
                        <span class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]"
                            >Proven Impact:</span
                        > Helped Clients Like Reshom And AJA International Achieve
                        A 10% Growth Post-Redesign.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <span class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]"
                            >Versatile Expertise:</span
                        > From Complex SaaS Dashboards To Sleek Portfolio Sites.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        <span class="font-bold text-[#1A1A1A]"
                            >Strategic Partnership:</span
                        > I Act As A Consultant For Your Brand, Ensuring Every Pixel
                        Serves A Purpose In The Digital Landscape.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
